#: ../../getting-started.md:1
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../getting-started.md:3
msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../getting-started.md:5
msgid "minacode supports <span class=\"marker\">macOS and Linux only</span>"
msgstr "minacode <span class=\"marker\">仅支持 macOS 和 Linux</span>"

#: ../../getting-started.md:6
msgid "Python 3.11 or newer"
msgstr "Python 3.11 或更新版本"

#: ../../getting-started.md:7
msgid "[uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) to install and run"
msgstr "使用 [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) 安装和运行"

#: ../../getting-started.md:13
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "升级"

#: ../../getting-started.md:19
msgid "minacode checks PyPI at most once a day and reports an available update at startup and in `/status`."
msgstr "minacode 每天最多检查一次 PyPI；有新版本时，会在启动时和 `/status` 中提示。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:22
msgid "Configure"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../getting-started.md:24
msgid "minacode needs one thing to start: <span class=\"marker\">a provider to talk to</span>. Generate a starter config:"
msgstr "minacode 启动只需要一项配置：<span class=\"marker\">用于通信的 provider</span>。先生成配置文件："

#: ../../getting-started.md:31
msgid "This writes `~/.minacode/config.toml`. Only the `[provider]` block is required; every other setting has a built-in default, and the file lists the common ones as comments."
msgstr "该命令会写入 `~/.minacode/config.toml`。只有 `[provider]` 是必需的；其他设置都有内置默认值，常用选项会以注释形式列在文件中。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:34
msgid "Point it at a provider"
msgstr "设置 provider"

#: ../../getting-started.md:36
msgid "minacode speaks to any OpenAI-compatible API (and to Anthropic). Open the config and fill in a provider — for example [DeepSeek](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/):"
msgstr "minacode 支持任何 OpenAI-compatible API，也直接支持 Anthropic。打开配置文件并填写一个 provider，例如 [DeepSeek](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/)："

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Key"
msgstr "配置项"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "`url`"
msgstr "`url`"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Base URL of the API"
msgstr "API 的 base URL"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "`key`"
msgstr "`key`"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Your API key"
msgstr "你的 API key"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "`model`"
msgstr "`model`"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Model name to use"
msgstr "使用的模型名称"

#: ../../getting-started.md:55
msgid "You can define several `[provider.<name>]` blocks and switch between them with `active` (or `/provider` inside a session). See [Configuration](configuration.md#providers) for optional provider, runtime, and data settings."
msgstr "可以定义多个 `[provider.<name>]`，通过 `active` 选择；也可以在 session 中使用 `/provider` 切换。可选的 provider、runtime 和数据设置见[配置](configuration.md#providers)。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:59
msgid "Start a session"
msgstr "启动 session"

#: ../../getting-started.md:65
msgid "Type a request in plain language and the agent starts working — reading files, proposing edits, running commands. Before anything that changes files or runs a command, it asks for confirmation (unless you pass `--yolo`). You can keep typing while it works; see [Follow-ups](usage.md#follow-ups)."
msgstr "直接用自然语言输入任务，agent 就会开始读取文件、提出修改并运行命令。任何会修改文件或执行命令的操作都会先请求确认，除非使用 `--yolo`。agent 工作时仍可继续输入；见[追加指令](usage.md#follow-ups)。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:70
msgid "Exit with `/exit`, `/quit`, or `Ctrl-D`."
msgstr "使用 `/exit`、`/quit` 或 `Ctrl-D` 退出。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:72
msgid "Command-line flags"
msgstr "命令行参数"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Flag"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "`-c`, `--last`, `--latest`"
msgstr "`-c`, `--last`, `--latest`"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Resume the most recent session in this project"
msgstr "恢复当前项目最近一次 session"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "`--resume [UID]`"
msgstr "`--resume [UID]`"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Resume a saved session; with no `UID`, resumes this project's latest"
msgstr "恢复保存的 session；不提供 `UID` 时恢复本项目最近一次"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "`--yolo`"
msgstr "`--yolo`"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Skip confirmation prompts for mutating tools"
msgstr "跳过修改型工具的确认提示"

#: ../../getting-started.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`--theme {auto,light,dark}`"
msgstr "`--theme {auto,light,dark}`"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Override the configured terminal color theme"
msgstr "覆盖终端颜色主题"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "`--config <path>`"
msgstr "`--config <path>`"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Use a specific config file instead of `~/.minacode/config.toml`"
msgstr "使用指定配置文件，而不是 `~/.minacode/config.toml`"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "`--init-config`"
msgstr "`--init-config`"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Write a starter config file and exit"
msgstr "写入初始配置后退出"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "`-h`, `--help`"
msgstr "`-h`, `--help`"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Show command-line help and exit"
msgstr "显示命令行帮助后退出"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "`-v`, `--version`"
msgstr "`-v`, `--version`"

#: ../../getting-started.md
msgid "Print the version and exit"
msgstr "输出版本号后退出"
